.jpg\" alt=\"Image: Dr. Rajeev Singh Raghuvanshi, Secretary-cum-Scientific Director IPC visited the CDSCO Zonal Office, Hyderabad on 1st March 2021\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/153582602_2932079650414343_8429419849549285411_o.jpg\" alt=\"Image: Dr. Rajeev Singh Raghuvanshi, Secretary-cum-Scientific Director IPC visited the CDSCO Zonal Office, Hyderabad on 1st March 2021\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/150185877_2932079673747674_6295340247701392349_o.jpg\" alt=\"Image: Dr. Rajeev Singh Raghuvanshi, Secretary-cum-Scientific Director IPC visited the CDSCO Zonal Office, Hyderabad on 1st March 2021\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ></p>","date":"2021-03-01","category":"Events"}